# Tickets Index

Master index of every technical ticket or task list, regardless of which track produced it:
- **`/refine --deep`** writes standalone ticket files directly under `docs/tickets/`, one per ticket.
- **`/change propose`**, **`/change ff`**, and **`/refine`** (standard mode) write a single `tasks.md` inside the change package, covering all its atomic tasks.

This file only **points to** the source of truth — it never duplicates ticket content. Update the `Path` and `Status` columns when a change moves (approved, archived); do not copy content here.

